      <p class="section-eyebrow">01 · WHY MURM</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Write the coordination, not the infrastructure</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Most multi-agent projects spend weeks rebuilding containers, gateways, and log pipelines — only to lock into one workflow. <code>murm</code> runs the swarm so you only write the rules.
      </p>
    </div>
